---

<Layout title="Couples & Families – Cristóbal Maturana" description="Couples and family photography by Cristóbal Maturana.">
  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Couples & Families</h1>
      <p>Genuine connection, beautifully captured.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="gallery-intro">
        <p>Whether it's a couple exploring a new city or a family sharing a quiet afternoon — I look for the real moments, the ones that happen between the posed ones.</p>
      </div>
      <Gallery images={images} layout="masonry" columns={3} />
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .gallery-intro {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
</style>
